{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778978883274,"sessionID":"ses_1cc9898d1ffe9Ff1mTnwBbhqKV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_WmKbqyUbYUvFsGQdnFhpqhF9","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"body\": \"**Mondo term (ID and Label)**\\nAutosomal recessive extra-oral halitosis MONDO:0034186\\n\\n**Reason for deprecation**\\nORDO:562538 (exact match on Mondo:0034186) reports it is an exact match to OMIM 618148 (exact match to MONDO:0029144)\\n\\n**Term to be merged with**\\nMONDO:0029144 Extraoral halitosis due to methanethiol oxidase deficiency\\n\\n**Your nano-attribution (ORCID)**\\nIf you don't have an ORCID, you can sign up for one [here](https://orcid.org/)\\n\",\n3:   \"comments\": [],\n4:   \"title\": \"[Merge]Extraoral halitosis due to methanethiol oxidase deficiency & Autosomal recessive extra-oral halitosis\",\n5:   \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9842\"\n6: }\n\n(End of file - total 6 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"body\": \"**Mondo term (ID and Label)**\\nAutosomal recessive extra-oral halitosis MONDO:0034186\\n\\n**Reason for deprecation**\\nORDO:562538 (exact match on Mondo:0034186) reports it is an exact match to OMIM 618148 (exact match to MONDO:0029144)\\n\\n**Term to be merged with**\\nMONDO:0029144 Extraoral halitosis due to methanethiol oxidase deficiency\\n\\n**Your nano-attribution (ORCID)**\\nIf you don't have an ORCID, you can sign up for one [here](https://orcid.org/)\\n\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"[Merge]Extraoral halitosis due to methanethiol oxidase deficiency & Autosomal recessive extra-oral halitosis\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9842\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_c