ped.\n+\n+Checks completed:\n+- Reviewed the imported issue context from `__issue_context__.json`.\n+- Inspected both source stanzas in `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo` before editing.\n+- Confirmed there were no remaining references to `MONDO:0034186` outside its own stanza before and after the change.\n+- Verified the final obsolete stanza contains only: `id`, obsolete `name`, `IAO:0000231`, `IAO:0000233`, `is_obsolete`, and `replaced_by`.\n+- Compared the pre-change obsolete stanza against the post-change surviving stanza to ensure meaningful content was preserved.\n+- Reviewed `git diff` for `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo` before commit.\n+\n+Environment limitation:\n+- I could not run the requested ODK-backed normalization / `robot verify` steps because `docker` is not available in this execution environment, so `make NORM` and targeted QC could not be executed here.\n+\n+Commit created:\n+- `c91a222` - `Merge duplicate extraoral halitosis terms`\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\n+Addressed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Obsoleted `MONDO:0034186` with direct replacement by `MONDO:0029144`, and migrated the useful Orphanet/GARD-facing metadata and synonym/classification content onto the surviving term.\n+\n+I also removed the scheduled-obsoletion-only metadata from the obsolete term stub as part of the cleanup.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,31 @